{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Midnight's Curse&quot; is a visual novel in the genre of psychological horror, where you find yourself in a fixated city, forgetting your own name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The time is frozen at 00:00. Reflections in mirrors live their own lives. Metro stations that are not on the map continue to operate. Someone is knocking on the ceiling. Someone is speaking in your voice. And the tickets found in the morning change the labels every day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unsettling streets, distorted spaces, and fragments of the past that slip away like a dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 13 chapters, three different endings, and choices that matter. Is it possible to defeat the system if you are already inside?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is suitable for fans of dark visual novels, meta-narrative and plots where the boundary between dream and reality is blurred.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to remember who you are before the clock shows 00:00 again?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3964050?t=1757342482","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964050/97c280c14da1b9decb84823174309c14e55cff7f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757342482","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964050/40e041b919fbd23cb3a24be5286b0eb617acdcb9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757342482","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964050/40e041b919fbd23cb3a24be5286b0eb617acdcb9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757342482","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Midnight's Curse&quot; is a visual novel in the genre of psychological horror, where you find yourself in a fixated city, forgetting your own name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The time is frozen at 00:00. Reflections in mirrors live their own lives. Metro stations that are not on the map continue to operate. Someone is knocking on the ceiling. Someone is speaking in your voice. And the tickets found in the morning change the labels every day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unsettling streets, distorted spaces, and fragments of the past that slip away like a dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 13 chapters, three different endings, and choices that matter. Is it possible to defeat the system if you are already inside?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is suitable for fans of dark visual novels, meta-narrative and plots where the boundary between dream and reality is blurred.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to remember who you are before the clock shows 00:00 again?</p>","developers":["Gamesforgames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964050/71da275cd1c5df2b133ca669351621b1a86eaf66/header.jpg?t=1757342482","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257185980,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257185980/movie480.mp4?t=1757157535","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257185980/movie_max.mp4?t=1757157535"},"name":"\u041f\u0440\u043e\u043a\u043b\u044f\u0442\u0438\u0435 \u043f\u043e\u043b\u0443\u043d\u043e\u0447\u0438","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257185980/927fdffc96c571d36b97489fceb28d2d8ea4b5cc/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757157535","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257185980/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757157535","m